# the avatar pushed into its platform: thrust has consequences
# the aether is never lost: it is simply everywhere at once
# the system bar stays up late: it holds all the menus
# the dock went to therapy: too many apps leaned on it
# a pane is just a window that failed to float
# why did the window float free? it needed space
# why orbit the sun? it was the only thing in our pane
# orbiter never crashes; it just changes its orbit
# the side panel never argues; it just folds
export 1.0.0
export views ['git': FileType.ascii, 'b16': FileType.agnostic]
# 32352

